# Firebender Ascension: an ability that an attack set off still triggered when it is removed from the stack for want of a legal target
# (CR 603.3d), so it is counted, and there is nothing to copy. Fervent Champion (haste) attacks alone each turn; its "another target
# attacking Knight you control gets +1/+0" has no target and is removed. Turns 1, 3, 5 and 7: four quest counters, and at the fourth
# no copy is offered.

